Author: Collie Kart project (based on CTRPluginFramework Blank Template)

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 3

Targets:

Title: Collie Kart Portable P003

Summary: MK7 read-only passive CSV flight recorder

Description: |
    Keeps the P001/P002 overlays and telemetry, adds user-controlled
    buffering of live telemetry with Stop & Save CSV to the SD card.
    No game-memory writing, input injection, or learning.
    MK7 memory addresses are derived from Citra and were observed
    to react plausibly on one USA New 3DS.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
